  "mail.intro": "Greetings, @.^I'm writing because I've made a rather... peculiar discovery in the mines.^It's a sword. But not just any sword. This one hums with ancient magic that even I, after all my years of study, cannot fully decipher. The blade resonates with the echo of a forgotten hero's spirit, waiting to be awakened.^I would keep it in my tower, but the magical energy there is already dangerously unstable. I fear the sword's presence might inadvertently summon something... or someone. The last thing I need is a heroic spirit materializing in my study demanding a Holy Grail. I already have enough problems with my ex-wife.^Take it, @. Plant it in your soil like a scarecrow. It will protect your crops from crows and, I suspect, water them as well. The magic seems to have a nurturing quality beneath its martial exterior.^Treat it with respect, and perhaps the spirit within will grant you its blessing.^- M. Rasmodius%item id (BC)ExcaliburScarecrow_Excalibur 1 %%[#]A gift from the Wizard",

